  text with markdown markers, a quoted markdown string, bare backticks, a
  code span in plain text, tags, and a written backslash-n. Only a quoted
  markdown string reads markdown; tags draw and a written \n breaks the line
  everywhere. Names, notes and annotations are quoted strings, so their plain
  and bare-backtick forms are written in quotes.
